1
00:00:00,308 --> 00:00:02,508
Your painkiller knows where it hurts.

2
00:00:02,534 --> 00:00:03,684
It doesn't.

3
00:00:04,232 --> 00:00:05,507
It seems to.

4
00:00:05,666 --> 00:00:09,791
You swallow one, the ankle feels better,
so the pill must have gone there.

5
00:00:10,347 --> 00:00:13,147
The pill dissolves and
passes into your blood.

6
00:00:13,293 --> 00:00:16,008
Its level peaks within one to two hours.

7
00:00:16,018 --> 00:00:20,118
It sticks to blood proteins, so it
mostly stays in the bloodstream.

8
00:00:20,421 --> 00:00:23,921
Blood reaches every organ,
and the drug travels with it.

9
00:00:24,483 --> 00:00:27,398
Hurt tissue switches on
an enzyme called COX-2.

10
00:00:27,408 --> 00:00:29,283
It makes prostaglandins.

11
00:00:29,432 --> 00:00:33,382
They make nerves more sensitive
to the chemicals injury releases.

12
00:00:33,692 --> 00:00:37,967
Ibuprofen blocks both versions of
that enzyme, everywhere it works.

13
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:42,035
The sore ankle is where that enzyme
is busiest, so the block removes

14
00:00:42,045 --> 00:00:43,270
the most there.

15
00:00:43,823 --> 00:00:46,038
The same block runs everywhere.

16
00:00:46,048 --> 00:00:49,923
Your stomach makes its own
prostaglandins to help guard its lining.

17
00:00:50,123 --> 00:00:52,613
Block it, and ulcers
and bleeding can happen.

18
00:00:52,623 --> 00:00:54,648
The label calls them serious.

19
00:00:54,952 --> 00:00:58,216
Your kidneys use prostaglandins
to keep blood flowing.

20
00:00:58,226 --> 00:01:02,351
In people with kidney problems,
ibuprofen can cut that flow.

21
00:01:02,929 --> 00:01:05,429
Not every painkiller plays this game.

22
00:01:05,632 --> 00:01:10,707
Paracetamol, or acetaminophen, has
almost no anti-inflammatory effect.

23
00:01:10,857 --> 00:01:13,572
It works mostly in the
brain and spinal cord.

24
00:01:13,582 --> 00:01:16,307
Scientists still argue about exactly how.

25
00:01:16,613 --> 00:01:20,263
Opioids like morphine work largely
through the nervous system.

26
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:22,884
So it doesn't know where your pain is.

27
00:01:23,072 --> 00:01:24,412
It doesn't need to.

28
00:01:24,422 --> 00:01:28,087
The sore spot is just the busiest
factory, and the pill shuts down

29
00:01:28,097 --> 00:01:29,997
every factory it reaches.
